      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. We're particularly worried about those \"ghost\" fragments of data that seem to persist even after a standard deletion command is run. Is there a specific way to audit for these residual traces to make sure the deletion is truly absolute and nothing is being left behind?",
      "source": "evaluator"
